<title>USA: Raytheon unit get $193 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Raytheon unit get $193 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytheon Co's unit, Raytheon E-Systems, said on Friday that it won a contract from the Defense Information Systems Agency for a total value of $193 million.</p>
<p>The company said the global command and control system maintenance and technical support contract includes a one-year base period and four additional one-year options.</p>
